    <p>Electrostatic shielding is used in a wide variety of applications:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Electronics:</b> Shielding electronic components and circuits from external interference (e.g., radio frequency interference - RFI).</li>
      <li><b>High-Voltage Equipment:</b> Protecting operators and sensitive equipment from strong electric fields.</li>
      <li><b>Cable Shielding:</b> Preventing signal leakage and interference in cables.</li>
      <li><b>Faraday Cages:</b> Demonstrating the principles of electrostatic shielding.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

    <div class="card">
